      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Welcome to OSV.dev Observability\n\nChoose the dashboard below that best matches what you are investigating:\n\n| Dashboard | Best For / Questions Answered | Key Signals |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **[1. Executive Overview & SLAs](/d/osv-exec-overview)** | **Overall health & SLO status** — *Is the public API healthy and fast? Are advisories published within our 2-hour freshness target?* | Cloud Run API availability & p99 latency, E2E publish-to-available lag, worker success rate |\n| **[2. Ingestion & Worker Pipeline Operations](/d/osv-pipeline-ingestion-ops)** | **On-call pipeline triage** — *Is Pub/Sub backed up? Are worker pools scaling and draining fast enough? Which tasks recently failed?* | Queue depth (`default` / `reimport` / `cves`), intake vs. drain rate, error log triage links, reconciler & deleter safety limits |\n| **[3. Vulnerability Data Quality & Ecosystem Health](/d/osv-data-quality-drift)** | **Dataset integrity & feed freshness** — *Are Datastore and GCS out of sync? Which upstream feeds are stale or triggering linter errors?* | `recordchecker` drift, `osv-linter` findings by source/rule, feed staleness, `all.zip` export sizes, Gitter SSD usage |\n| **[4. CVE & Feed Conversions](/d/osv-cve-feed-conversions)** | **`vulnfeeds/` & CNA conversion quality** — *Why are CVEs failing to convert? How are CVEListV5, NVD, Debian, and Alpine converters running?* | Conversion funnel & outcomes, range extraction sources, Assigner CNA scorecards, `vulnfeeds/` CronJob status |\n\n---\n**Planned Deep-Dive Dashboards (Upcoming):** *5. API Serving & Analytics* · *6. Gitter & Recoverer Deep-Dive* · *7. CronJobs & Storage Capacity*\n\n*Tip: Click the **Plutono** icon or **Home** in the top-left navigation from any dashboard to return to this directory.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
